      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MILLIONDOLLAR KISS (9) put together a series of minor placings then raised her game last start on September 9 over 2040m at this track, getting home by 1.3 metres. May just need a bit of luck at some point from this difficult draw. Meets a similar line up so she can keep the ball rolling. SHEEZ GOT TORQUE (2) was responsible for a very good effort last time over 1780m here, finishing second and just a neck from the winner. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Won't find this any harder and she can grab a win. TERRAGONG SWINGER (6) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when he finished third at this circuit over 2040m. Don't dismiss lightly. THE HARRIS HAWK (5) is racing well and could feature again.",
